 "states": {
  "$doc": "q->state banding for the De-Dupe UI presentation layer (per unified-scoring: the four comparison states are BANDS over the engine's per-field continuous quality q). Consumed by the work-list producer / scoring service when building payloads (dedupe-worklist.md section 4); NOT used in scoring itself. identical: q >= identical_at (or exact match after normalization); similar: q >= similar_at; below similar_at the state is mismatch when the field is discriminative (conflict-bearing), else neutral; a field absent on either side (quality None) is neutral. Per-field overrides win over defaults.",
  "default": {
   "identical_at": 0.985,
   "similar_at": 0.75
